OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing flooding,
OL,8,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts
OL,9,Facross the UK - here's the latest
OL,10,Fforecast
OL,12,FMore than 80,000 customers across Great
OL,13,FBritain were without power this
OL,14,Fmorning, and there are also power cuts
OL,15,Facross the island of Ireland
OL,17,FVideo from Largs, in Ayrshire, showed
OL,18,Fwater flowing through the town centre -
OL,19,Fwhile the tracks were submerged at
OL,20,FDalmarnock station in Glasgow
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
