OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the railways, people are being told
OL,8,Fnot to travel north of Preston. On the
OL,9,FEast Coast, LNER advises against travel
OL,10,Fnorth of Edinburgh
OL,12,FA number of flights have been
OL,13,Fcancelled, including more than 20 from
OL,14,FLeeds Bradford, while many ferry
OL,15,Fservices are also suspended
OL,17,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,18,Facross large parts of Scotland and
OL,19,Fnorthern England, with a range of
OL,20,Fevents cancelled
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
